WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.157 line:100%,end
The driver can attach
up to five photos to a fault report.

00:00:05.157 --> 00:00:09.100 line:100%,end
Describe the fault
and tap Add photo.

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:13.159 line:100%,end
The photos are shrunk automatically
before sending.

00:00:13.159 --> 00:00:16.000 line:100%,end
Finally, tap Save.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.836 line:100%,end
The maintenance person sees the photos
next to the fault on the Reports page.

00:00:20.836 --> 00:00:26.000 line:100%,end
The fault description, the driver's assessment
and the photos are in the same view.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.731 line:100%,end
Tap the thumbnail
to open the photo full size.

00:00:29.731 --> 00:00:34.700 line:100%,end
The photo shows at once what needs fixing
and which parts are needed.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:38.475 line:100%,end
The administrator sees the same photos
on the unit page.

00:00:38.475 --> 00:00:43.900 line:100%,end
The photos are visible to your own company's
maintenance people and administrators.
